      "content": "That 10-15% drop in speed is a big deal. I'm seeing a lot of risk in the \"cascading failures\" you mentioned. Can you dive deeper into that? Specifically, if we move away from the central core, how exactly does the lack of a single synchronization engine lead to these failures? I need to know if this is just a minor hiccup or if the whole system becomes fundamentally unstable without the central engine.",
